{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01049","headline":"相和歌辞 江南曲 · 张籍","name":"相和歌辞 江南曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江南人家多橘树，吴姬舟上织白紵。\n土地卑湿饶虫蛇，连木爲牌入江住。\n江村亥日长爲市，落帆渡桥来浦里。\n青莎覆城竹爲屋，无井家家饮潮水。\n长江午日酤春酒，高高酒旗悬江口。\n倡楼两岸悬水栅，夜唱竹枝留北客。\n江南风土欢乐多，悠悠处处尽经过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01049.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01049","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}